// auto-calculated Experience Level — NOT a user-selectable 3-option dropdown). Status
// (Active/On Leave) is confirmed to live on the list row's "More options > Change Status"
// menu, not inside the wizard. Steps beyond 3 were not reached live this session (tab
// contention with concurrent sibling subagents — see docs/dom-snapshots/staff.json
